e" ulx="110" uly="1125" lrx="537" lry="1163" /><zone xml:id="m-62b3b893-ec02-4414-9c51-bb19af2525b3" ulx="549" uly="1125" lrx="974" lry="1162" /><zone xml:id="m-7701b7d6-b35f-42b9-a237-e5cc1746e51e" ulx="548" uly="1152" lrx="976" lry="1185" /><zone xml:id="m-1bdf19b3-f0e6-4289-a3a3-1a3f2d879506" ulx="110" uly="1154" lrx="537" lry="1187" /><zone xml:id="m-e5eba2ae-6891-4771-bad4-a5243ffba9be" ulx="547" uly="1178" lrx="977" lry="1211" /><zone xml:id="m-7cbb4fe1-d096-4119-bf64-d7d78f8eea2f" ulx="110" uly="1180" lrx="538" lry="1210" /><zone xml:id="m-53a91abe-002c-4179-bb22-fc45be3a22a8" ulx="111" uly="1206" lrx="537" lry="1245" /><zone xml:id="m-433d4407-3416-4c4b-9bf6-c05a0b62a47b" ulx="548" uly="1206" lrx="977" lry="1242" /><zone xml:id="m-ee85c5b7-4d08-4b6e-a305-aed010f46a8d" ulx="549" uly="1232" lrx="804" lry="1267" /><zone xml:id="m-e2a2fdd9-bd53-4e39-b646-ce438eaf3ae1" ulx="110" uly="1234" lrx="538" lry="1267" /><zone xml:id="m-8b78e8e1-4541-4415-8be1-5a4956dede4a" ulx="110" uly="1260" lrx="541" lry="1298" /><zone xml:id="m-9162e6e4-a3d0-4311-a844-f6dbbd512898" ulx="113" uly="1295" lrx="975" lry="1332" /><zone xml:id="m-d0c0295c-1b20-44e2-87cc-8d496d95a975" ulx="133" uly="1327" lrx="973" lry="1365" /><zone xml:id="m-c0e46780-3ad5-4a55-b410-e38f54fce4ac" ulx="114" uly="1355" lrx="541" lry="1395" /><zone xml:id="m-de4455a2-3e4a-4738-8e52-584fa9a6ae41" ulx="547" uly="1356" lrx="977" lry="1388" /><zone xml:id="m-b7059c69-ace1-4bea-9d7b-aa9448268fb4" ulx="548" uly="1382" lrx="979" lry="1420" /><zone xml:id="m-b873d4e8-3c2d-48f0-876d-9bd311e93551" ulx="112" uly="1384" lrx="540" lry="1418" /><zone xml:id="m-51e9bffa-8030-45eb-bc30-f374827cd8a8" ulx="550" uly="1410" lrx="979" lry="1444" /><zone xml:id="m-a58e17b9-1a30-41df-97c4-664221dbbd0d" ulx="112" uly="1412" lrx="538" lry="1446" /><zone xml:id="m-0af313a3-0311-4135-bb8a-b60a598708a9" ulx="112" uly="1437" lrx="539" lry="1469" /><zone xml:id="m-55eed270-94ef-4d34-87a1-38804a79b04e" ulx="549" uly="1439" lrx="979" lry="1468" /><zone xml:id="m-40f11989-fe09-426c-be47-0cee31ab2872" ulx="549" uly="1462" lrx="979" lry="1499" /><zone xml:id="m-04287bec-f788-48a2-98d3-7caab78b1e3b" ulx="113" uly="1464" lrx="540" lry="1499" /><zone xml:id="m-b417c2e8-5ca6-4488-988f-f99c59bdbaee" ulx="113" uly="1491" lrx="541" lry="1523" /><zone xml:id="m-ba307bd4-fa21-4a6d-a1e6-6fe36e57fd40" ulx="552" uly="1495" lrx="977" lry="1524" /><zone xml:id="m-6341301b-17d7-40c1-b5f5-e1fadb5c579f" ulx="116" uly="1517" lrx="693" lry="1556" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-42b447db-0fcc-4713-9528-9e3d63162f31" n="2062" facs="#m-cde432a3-8d6d-42f2-b652-5d639a0d7e56" /><div xml:id="m-1902861a-cf4e-45eb-9757-d3aafd1b5652">
            <lg xml:id="m-b5559047-4a6e-42d0-b76e-8583bb72560c">
              <l xml:id="m-e34258ed-8122-4588-8334-572855586322" facs="#m-f8aa288b-a0ad-41c5-b472-f7be612349ca" label="ambiguous">1s1e</l><l xml:id="m-0aaddf66-8720-4e21-a911-d0ba3fe0f9e7" facs="#m-c29d975a-f332-4f3a-b2f2-edb0bac9ecc6" label="text-like">Masses for the Dead.</l><l xml:id="m-05c59545-d7f1-47fc-934d-b9a18f5051f9" facs="#m-278a1b85-d32d-4f21-8608-516a808d3829" label="text-like">After Mass, if the corpse be in the church, the ceremony called Absolution</l><l xml:id="m-a54120ad-042b-4ceb-a953-de59b5edc10f" facs="#m-10ec3a94-ed91-41f6-82ef-bc97e276fe3a" label="text-like">takes place as on p.1766. When the body or the deceased is not present, and</l><l xml:id="m-1933302b-5e85-460e-9b18-408aa51021a0" facs="#m-68d482d8-e4d3-4942-9160-2d79cd75e470" label="text-like">also on the third, seventh, and thirtieth days after the death, the Absolution</l><l xml:id="m-c3c02a1c-1549-4d58-a42d-a26d1b7cee5a" facs="#m-d7ff0388-868a-414c-9a0f-af78a04957dc" label="text-like">takes place as on p. 1820.</l><l xml:id="m-1d5de0a3-a6c9-49d0-a921-453da3351441" facs="#m-9065866f-22ad-41e2-a799-d4f2b95b318d" label="text-like">T On the third, seventh, and thirtieth days after the death, the Mass for the</l><l xml:id="m-9c1daca8-1175-4b11-b574-0a37826b4678" facs="#m-03026d7d-3e61-4cf4-b456-960c630fa540" label="text-like">day of burial is said, but the Collect. Secret, and Postcommunion are as follows:</l><l xml:id="m-5e1e6fea-c404-43a6-945f-7f9c1593d32a" facs="#m-c8ea810e-9ef7-4c4f-bd82-62b656cbebff" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-b52c40f0-2662-4ae2-b905-678b73719085" facs="#m-1c3b002b-2547-4a64-9e2a-cc95a2ad3fc1" label="lyrics-like">Uaésumus Dómine, ut ánimae! morámus, Sanctórum atque electó¬</l><l xml:id="m-1dafaf4e-f6f0-4f4f-bb24-b9ec388804de" facs="#m-b1a5c9d8-9e8e-4d2d-b22b-4d1c794f5817" label="lyrics-like">U fámuli tui N. (fámulae tuae N.), lrum tuórum largiri dignéris consór¬</l><l xml:id="m-87a7bffd-4354-4b0c-af64-df3b26e200a8" facs="#m-2988c812-0ce4-4b36-b84c-d88ba9a9449e" label="lyrics-like">cujus depositiónis diem tértium (or</l><l xml:id="m-21f24a89-cfd7-4012-a4ac-41b1679c0e29" facs="#m-382bacc9-e87b-41fc-b16b-96020a37b38a" label="lyrics-like">tium: et rorem misericórdiae tuae</l><l xml:id="m-2fee3785-c176-4b18-b388-baf3fe738e57" facs="#m-cbc6aafc-ed46-4657-9c14-369aef057f15" label="lyrics-like">séptimum, or trigésimum) comme-] perénnem infúndas. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-3e4d0222-d7a3-49fa-8327-66b4ae978e64" facs="#m-776fdaab-83a4-4951-a840-76c9c0b8b367" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-7bc551ea-13ce-4345-a860-5ff546a857e5" facs="#m-74035617-f6b2-4d19-84b0-eab239999624" label="lyrics-like">Unera, quaésumus Dómine,] placátus inténde: ut remédiis pur¬</l><l xml:id="m-eefdf1b5-e801-498a-b4c7-7748f001b773" facs="#m-1b336a61-8c96-40b7-959a-9f3195fc091b" label="lyrics-like">AC quae tibi pro ánima fámuli l gáta caeléstibus, in tua pietáte re¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7adc74f-19a3-4105-95e5-0d5f6839d519" facs="#m-781967d9-98fa-46f2-8c71-664410a3a306" label="lyrics-like">tui N. (fámulae tuae N.), offérimus, quiéscat. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-247ef5e1-0330-4160-a2ab-d00b43757cac" facs="#m-d436adaa-a0d7-47e9-85fc-4ad57457bc8f" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-a8466e56-847a-47e6-be7f-7d43af91c6af" facs="#m-e05225f3-c011-4db8-9331-1587e2cfd06b" label="lyrics-like">NUscipe Dómine preces nostras! de terrénis contágiis adhaesérunt,</l><l xml:id="m-ba69f1af-7672-4e3d-b7e3-cc4bd2debdbc" facs="#m-13052878-b1d0-4774-9dd6-2e2be7751e9f" label="lyrics-like">O pro ánima fámusi tui N. (fámu-[remissiónis tuae misericórdia de¬</l><l xml:id="m-1ac38bbb-4714-4d44-83a8-b507f79c5f4a" facs="#m-0a2433de-6889-4361-b693-81c26c052f15" label="lyrics-like">lae tuae N.) :ut, si quae ei máculae! leántur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-a4a8b8bb-8a70-4615-a801-e1d990d3b7ce" facs="#m-4a060a1a-e59b-458c-9481-425135b7919a" label="text-like">T For a Sovereign Pontiff, a Cardinal, a Bishop, or a Priest, on the dar</l><l xml:id="m-893b60fe-fe48-4c96-9d92-7ee0aaa7fc83" facs="#m-6f8c38ce-c376-4bc7-be1c-ce76b500bff5" label="text-like">of burial and on the anniversary days, the Mass said is that of the Comme¬</l><l xml:id="m-f9cd21fd-a3b0-4072-8e35-ce45df283c85" facs="#m-b13ee330-2200-4096-9589-c1ff4f63260e" label="text-like">moration of all the Faithrul departed, p. 1806, with the Collect, Secret, and</l><l xml:id="m-6c48349b-8e06-454d-b3f6-69787ce77720" facs="#m-66399df9-02e2-48c4-988e-afcb8d170e25" label="text-like">Postcommunion as given in the Various Prayers, pp. 1821-1822.</l><l xml:id="m-967f1064-438c-43e0-bbd2-69d3d1ba9c71" facs="#m-7178ea87-8136-46fb-95a5-0099bf701f80" label="text-like">III. — ON THE ANNIVERSARY DAY OF THE DEATH.</l><l xml:id="m-970911ab-9a4a-45c4-8036-48e974b6bfb1" facs="#m-d14cedbb-d034-429f-be52-01d2573e6807" label="text-like">The Mass is said as on the day of burial, p. 1807, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-07035511-f38b-4e14-b4d6-e36e6ea52b06" facs="#m-b81a811f-eb8b-4d1f-8132-c719b3dde66f" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-c4ba3c35-f4c2-427b-96a5-85cba90b296e" facs="#m-f56b1880-8beb-4769-b6ca-cefdb91f0508" label="lyrics-like">Eus indulgentiárum Dómine, t positiónis diem commemorámus,</l><l xml:id="m-0af965d1-1f59-44c0-a8e9-44821c8f4d33" facs="#m-50cb507e-b3c3-4bcb-bce2-2de5a26e94b3" label="lyrics-like">U da ánimae fámuli tui N. (fa- refrigéri sedem, quiétis beatitúdi¬</l><l xml:id="m-dd9f671f-4831-4e3a-97de-f91c9f402c2b" facs="#m-796dddb7-f967-4d34-a23b-c7ac57dd9f99" label="lyrics-like">nem, et lúminis claritátem. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-299798ff-335b-4c73-a102-3719c7574473" facs="#m-7d81b7fd-de61-4d8c-a893-fc84d3c731e1" label="lyrics-like">mulae tuae N., or animábus fa¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ba67ed0-7b00-432c-8e79-dd4c2451edc9" facs="#m-45452d9c-b05a-4ac7-a131-e10077c31e25" label="lyrics-like">mulórum famularúmque tuárum),</l><l xml:id="m-cfe531d7-5108-432b-8217-3489857d7fc3" facs="#m-18465658-9d8e-4e0d-8b80-9c9f630ab210" label="ambiguous">minum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-6e277161-bd20-4726-8010-73d1947f1179" facs="#m-eea4391a-fef6-42b1-9082-1a08f53e8012" label="lyrics-like">cujus (quorum) anniversárium de¬</l><l xml:id="m-e95b65cc-5251-4776-8f77-eb23a8d94aa8" facs="#m-916756bb-c593-4ec2-8683-f9abbe065e6c" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Machabaeorum. 2. Mach. 12, 43-46.</l><l xml:id="m-144de495-2839-4901-b2a4-933a9c81f85c" facs="#m-91771dd3-caa7-4f6f-a31f-7785ad1030dd" label="lyrics-like">Ndiébus illis: Vir fortíssimus) et vanum orâre pro mórtuis) </l><l xml:id="m-dab8706c-4bf8-47b8-ab3d-83a08872a7b1" facs="#m-b8246b4f-0a5f-415f-b1e3-366c691f8eb5" label="lyrics-like">1 Judas, facta collatióne, duódecim</l><l xml:id="m-931021e0-2c4c-4a3a-9e12-f21789d9c91e" facs="#m-a4307be8-09ad-41f8-a60e-99fe97200fb7" label="lyrics-like">quia considerábat quod hi, qui cum</l><l xml:id="m-c05862bd-0922-4a5d-824f-1008b9efce0e" facs="#m-0f41fe31-4a0c-462d-803a-5e1b6485085e" label="lyrics-like">millia drachmas argénti misit Jero¬</l><l xml:id="m-b5b1bd0e-ca42-4803-99bc-22c0027090ab" facs="#m-62b3b893-ec02-4414-9c51-bb19af2525b3" label="lyrics-like">pietáte dormitiónem accéperant,</l><l xml:id="m-b378e9a8-a753-4a22-a296-c8338cd69fe2" facs="#m-7701b7d6-b35f-42b9-a237-e5cc1746e51e" label="lyrics-like">óptimam habérent repósitam grá¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7a56409-bc05-4ad5-a303-fc9180c29fee" facs="#m-1bdf19b3-f0e6-4289-a3a3-1a3f2d879506" label="lyrics-like">sólymam offérri pro peccátis mor¬</l><l xml:id="m-108e4414-e75a-49b2-bfb0-9902be8625a3" facs="#m-e5eba2ae-6891-4771-bad4-a5243ffba9be" label="lyrics-like">tiam. Sancta ergo et salúbris est</l><l xml:id="m-40f5d49d-0a91-4a1e-a9d3-e4454c088dbd" facs="#m-7cbb4fe1-d096-4119-bf64-d7d78f8eea2f" label="lyrics-like">tuórum sacrifícium, bene et reli¬</l><l xml:id="m-eb5204b7-d5e5-4620-8320-ef9cafc05e7f" facs="#m-53a91abe-002c-4179-bb22-fc45be3a22a8" label="lyrics-like">gióse de resurrectióne cógitans (nisi</l><l xml:id="m-034a6906-8a9f-415d-b508-2961d20715d9" facs="#m-433d4407-3416-4c4b-9bf6-c05a0b62a47b" label="lyrics-like">cogitátio pro defúnctis exoráre, ut</l><l xml:id="m-cd1a7fe8-8230-4daf-880e-08ac707c2422" facs="#m-ee85c5b7-4d08-4b6e-a305-aed010f46a8d" label="lyrics-like">a peccátis solvántur.</l><l xml:id="m-fae09a1b-d058-434a-9001-64e583cade5e" facs="#m-e2a2fdd9-bd53-4e39-b646-ce438eaf3ae1" label="lyrics-like">enim eos qui ceciderant, resurrectú¬</l><l xml:id="m-bbaf3c65-319d-46a1-a8ee-31e10fc4e35d" facs="#m-8b78e8e1-4541-4415-8be1-5a4956dede4a" label="lyrics-like">ros speráret, supérfluum viderétur,</l><l xml:id="m-3a99ebb0-8729-40b1-9e30-8337fd3c4fb2" facs="#m-9162e6e4-a3d0-4311-a844-f6dbbd512898" label="ambiguous">★ Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joann. 6, 37-40.</l><l xml:id="m-38fe7320-c07d-4037-a62c-b0d77c22bad4" facs="#m-d0c0295c-1b20-44e2-87cc-8d496d95a975" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus tur-Patris: ut omne quod dedit mihi,</l><l xml:id="m-2f7fbf9f-da71-4da8-a3b3-757a59505117" facs="#m-c0e46780-3ad5-4a55-b410-e38f54fce4ac" label="lyrics-like">L bis Judacórum: Omne quod dat</l><l xml:id="m-d51838de-c409-4049-82d3-68b9fb3ac3bd" facs="#m-de4455a2-3e4a-4738-8e52-584fa9a6ae41" label="lyrics-like">non perdam ex eo, sed resúscitem</l><l xml:id="m-28a9eaeb-1b10-420c-a66b-23fc8220927d" facs="#m-b7059c69-ace1-4bea-9d7b-aa9448268fb4" label="ambiguous">illud in novissimo die. Haec est</l><l xml:id="m-8e3e307f-2365-4326-9f94-c9e41a5ad33b" facs="#m-b873d4e8-3c2d-48f0-876d-9bd311e93551" label="lyrics-like">mihi Pater, ad me véniet : et eum</l><l xml:id="m-5d07f851-2a94-4f0a-8657-8e4d44363248" facs="#m-51e9bffa-8030-45eb-bc30-f374827cd8a8" label="lyrics-like">autem volúntas Patris mei qui misit</l><l xml:id="m-8f6c6f95-7564-4d19-8a22-73d03e09a853" facs="#m-a58e17b9-1a30-41df-97c4-664221dbbd0d" label="ambiguous">qui venit ad me non ejiciam foras;</l><l xml:id="m-6ab6414b-ee3d-4557-ba87-4d9c410fe903" facs="#m-0af313a3-0311-4135-bb8a-b60a598708a9" label="lyrics-like">quia descéndi de caelo, non ut fá¬</l><l xml:id="m-27685344-f909-42b3-a0e6-c1e5354e4fa8" facs="#m-55eed270-94ef-4d34-87a1-38804a79b04e" label="ambiguous">me: ut omnis qui videt Filium et</l><l xml:id="m-15355a9d-ffd0-4ce9-978c-5297783be6ee" facs="#m-40f11989-fe09-426c-be47-0cee31ab2872" label="lyrics-like">credit in eum, hábeat vitam aetér¬</l><l xml:id="m-c1323f17-f01e-4191-ab31-dd6e2fa08cdc" facs="#m-04287bec-f788-48a2-98d3-7caab78b1e3b" label="lyrics-like">ciam voluntátem meam, sed volun¬</l><l xml:id="m-57aec4a4-d5a6-44df-bdb0-ef6edcde3ea2" facs="#m-b417c2e8-5ca6-4488-988f-f99c59bdbaee" label="lyrics-like">tátem ejus qui misit me. Haec est</l><l xml:id="m-db781251-aa96-40fc-8591-21559431a073" facs="#m-ba307bd4-fa21-4a6d-a1e6-6fe36e57fd40" label="lyrics-like">nam : et ego resuscitábo eum in no¬</l><l xml:id="m-885d5a96-9a1c-4d21-9cc4-1320d08d760d" facs="#m-6341301b-17d7-40c1-b5f5-e1fadb5c579f" label="lyrics-like">autem volúntas ejus qui misit me, lvíssimo die</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>